      "index": 0,
      "mapName": "Adrienne1.h3m",
      "regionText": "The peasantry has been slaughtered to make an undead army.  It is as if someone is farming the people to grow a mammoth crop of mindless soldiers.  The purpose of this army is still unknown, but someone must restore order on the Ertahian-Tatalian border.  That someone is you.",
      "prologText": "Traveling from Erathia to my homeland of Tatalia, I have passed through several towns.   I have yet to encounter a living soul.  There is only the lingering stench of the undead.  I fear a necromancer in the area is raising an army.  'Who...' is unknown.  'Why...' is unknown.",
